  charge 2 alone: Omega^s = rho_s(psi), psi = 0.1955 pi (mod pi); Omega^q angle = -0.3045 pi; mismatch of reciprocal parts (mod pi) = 0.5 pi
  safe domain: n = exp(X) with spectrum of d rho_s(X) in |Im| < pi gives rho(n)^{1/2} = rho(exp(X/2)): max |Im spec dSym2(X)| / pi = 1.6 > 1 here
